<title>USA: FAC Realty approves buyback.</title>
<headline>FAC Realty approves buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CARY, N.C. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Realty Inc said Tuesday that it approved the repurchase of up to two million shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company has 12.10 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The shares were up 3/8 at 6-1/8 in early morning trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchases are to be made from time to time in the open market or directly from shareholders.</p>
<p>FAC Realty is a self-administered REIT engaged in the management, leasing, marketing, development and acquisition of outlet and community shopping centers.</p>
</text>
